                        width: 1,
                      ),
                    ),
                    child: Row(
                      mainAxisSize: MainAxisSize.min,
                      children: [
                        Text(
                          statusText == 'SAFE' ? 'Very Safe' : statusText,
                          style: TextStyle(
                            fontSize: 9.5,
                            fontWeight: FontWeight.w800,
                            letterSpacing: 0.4,
                            color: statusText == 'SAFE' ? const Color(0xff00E5A8) : statusColor,
                          ),
